    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280550/extras/e1501ea8ebba64af3de73cdbb04c1a42.avif?t=1744972211\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280550/extras/332a5375a9e9ade471a03409e7f2b725.avif?t=1744972211\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Hashie may be a weird little alien hash ball, but that doesn't stop it from being a great digital pet.<br>Hashie is a game about raising, well, a Hashie!<br>With over 8 Hashie varieties to hatch, endless personalities, and a Keeper Score to raise, Hashie is sure to be your new go-to for down-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a simple, intuitive UI to feed, water, and entertain your new friend. Laugh and smile as it gambols about. And most of all, enjoy your Hashie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280550/extras/e1501ea8ebba64af3de73cdbb04c1a42.avif?t=1744972211\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280550/extras/332a5375a9e9ade471a03409e7f2b725.avif?t=1744972211\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Hashie may be a weird little alien hash ball, but that doesn't stop it from being a great digital pet.<br>Hashie is a game about raising, well, a Hashie!<br>With over 8 Hashie varieties to hatch, endless personalities, and a Keeper Score to raise, Hashie is sure to be your new go-to for down-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a simple, intuitive UI to feed, water, and entertain your new friend. Laugh and smile as it gambols about. And most of all, enjoy your Hashie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
